<title>USA: TABLE - Silicom Ltd Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Silicom Ltd Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(U.S. dollars, in thousands - except for per share amounts)</p>
<p>			  Three-month period     Six Month period</p>
<p>			    ended June 30,    ended June 30,</p>
<p>			1997	 1996	   1997    1996</p>
<p> Revenues	  $3,024    $1,368	 $5,678  $2,528</p>
<p> Net income	   420	 141	    728     228</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>  share		0.10	0.04	   0.18    0.06</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding     4,101     4,000	  4,110   4,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said current Q2 revenue growth is primarily due to increased sales of multi-function PC Card products.</p>
